<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`LIST_STAT_GEOMETRIC_MEAN: number = 9`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer LIST_STAT_GEOMETRIC_MEAN = 9;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant LIST_STAT_GEOMETRIC_MEAN has the value 9</p>
  <p>Returns the geometric mean of a list of numbers.</p>
  <p>For two numbers, <i>a</i> and <i>b</i>, the geometric mean is <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSqrt" target="_blank">llSqrt</a>(a<i>b). For a list of </i>n* numbers, the geometric mean is the n-th root of their product. It indicates the central tendency or typical value to expect. It only works for positive numbers.</p>
  <p>In comparison, the arithmetic mean (known as the average) is the sum of the numbers divided by how many numbers there are.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
